Encapsulation and generalization both help the drawing process by allowing me
to simplify lines of code into a single line function. It also makes it easier
for reuse and for readability.
And also allows me to...well generalize my functions.
This makes it to where I have more freedom
when it comes to what I want to do with them, imagine haveing to specify
where all 30 of those stars went and how big they had to be, not only would
that be really tedious but also require a lot more testing to make sure that it
was done right.